  "description": "OpenAI-compatible hosted inference server over CircleAI.Hosting.InferenceBridge. Endpoints: /v1/chat/completions (SSE streaming), /v1/embeddings, /v1/companion/*, /v1/diagnostics, /v1/healthz, /v1/readyz. JWT and API-key auth out of the box. Ships Dockerfile, systemd unit, and a Windows-service install script. 1.3.5 picks up CircleAI.Inference 1.3.5 — adds android-arm (32-bit ARMv7) + ios-arm64. SDK now consumable from MAUI on 5 client platforms (osx-arm64, osx-x64, android-arm64, android-arm, ios-arm64). Server runtimes unchanged: win-x64, linux-x64, osx-arm64, osx-x64.",
